            "notes": "no, you are NOT allowed to pick ANYTHING BUT  [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) as your power. im sick of anyone saying otherwise. you NEED to be able to self-heal the entire game; its what is gonna keep you alive AND get you free heals\n\nsince this is a high WP build, you'll want to constantly (but within your means) push for the highest WP perks that are also the most beneficial to the build, which is why  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) and  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) help with this. the more heals early game, the more money, the more you snowball\n\nlastly we have  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) to make you a bit bulkier and heal even faster when there aren't any teammates around\n\nas for playstyle, up until you get  [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) try to play a bit distant--do not be afraid to also disengage losing battles to prevent team stagger",
