            "notes": "things are ramping up!!! if your team was just an iron fist on round 1 and didnt take any damage / you suck and died a lot / you got no heals even though thats ur job, thats fine. prioritize picking up  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e). This is the best combo to run with a simple 10k that gives you the most WP possible while also giving you a nice passive ability to help heal ur teammates quicker\n\nif you are mr moneybags and didnt die the entire first round / had insane heals, congrats. if you got above 14k, consider buying  [Caduceus Ex](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7), with  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) which although gives a bit of inferior WP, gives you a larger range which pays itself off a lot more in (a) staying alive by being safer and (b) letting you heal in more cheeky situations\n\nfeel free to keep  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) or  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) if you made below 14k though.",
