            "notes": "battle mercy is officially here with  [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) being the next power choice. with this, your ult is no longer something you actively do anything in, other than whip out ur pistol, dodge as much as attacks as possible and go crazy (try to go for squishies first)\n\nbuy  [Caduceus Ex](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7) if you didn't already have it, this lets us heal teammates from a further distance and ensure we stay out of trouble...although, if you have the extra cash and you feel it isnt making a difference shoot for buy either  [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) or  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) if you can't reasonably getting those ability proc's for the WP stack (i prefer amari personally). \n\nwe keep  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) , and if you have a bit more money you can keep the green perks from earlier in the build, or even top it off with  [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f)\n\nkeep your gameplay outside of valkyrie the same--heal ur squishies first, keep ur distance, mark your exits and leave a fight before its too late to prevent dying and sitting in respawn while ur other supp makes more money than u",
